Z||000000||onfire||11-09-2000||03:20 AM||||In the dec.00 Hotrod magazine, there is an article about Ed Newton that starts on page 55. On page 56 he has a few drawings of the Roach Coach. Anyway I was wondering if anyone had pictures of the real thing? I have surfed the net and can't seem to find any. The last time I saw a picture of it was probably 20yrs ago or so.<P>------------------<BR>"I know a little bit about everything, and alot about nothing"<BR><A HREF="http://homestead.deja.com/user.on_fire/on_fire.html" TARGET=_blank>Check out my waist of banbwidth.</A>||||reg||1
